Package: networkeditor
Version: 0.1.2-1
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Architecture: i386
Depends: libclamcore0-dev (>= 0.8), libclamprocessing0-dev (>= 0.8), libclamaudioio0-dev (>= 0.8), libclamvmqt0-dev (>= 0.8)
Maintainer: CLAM development team <clam@iua.upf.es>
Description: dsp system prototyping tool
 The networkeditor is a graphic application meant for designing
 audio and music digital signal processing systems. networkeditor
 features a GUI following the metaphor of specifying DSP components
 as 'boxes' and connecting them to define the DSP system data flow.
